# GitHub Linguist hints (language statistics only; no effect on checkout or line endings).
# The CLI's scaffold templates use a .tmpl extension, which Linguist reads as Go Template.
# The suffix before the extension names the real language of each file.
src/Blaizio.Cli/Assets/templates/**/*~razor.tmpl linguist-language=HTML+Razor
src/Blaizio.Cli/Assets/templates/**/*~cs.tmpl linguist-language=C#
src/Blaizio.Cli/Assets/templates/**/*~html.tmpl linguist-language=HTML
